<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cifra, Soriana started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cifra, Soriana started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Lyonnais began coverage of Mexican retailer Cifra S.A. with a hold rating and retailer Organizacion Soriana S.A. with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Shannon O'Neil said Mexican retail companies have seen their share prices rise sharply this year on hopes of a domestic economic recovery.</p>
</text>
